PODFoam: optional analysis_func and mesh_func hooks

HOOKS.md describes two more python_module.py functions, which only the
master rank calls. mesh_func gets the cell centres, volumes, solution
directions and cell polygons before the first time step: a face on the
first empty patch for each cell that has one, or, with no empty patch, a
plane slice of each cut cell. analysis_func runs each time step after
the POD step, with the time index, snapshot count, residuals, Courant
and continuity numbers and copies of U and p. Neither changes U or p;
with analysis_func the POD step collects a snapshot every time step.

